Portable CPU BN254 arithmetic
------------------------------

The portable kernels under src/ adapt Montgomery arithmetic,
signed Pippenger and affine batching techniques from these reference projects:

- Aeglos, https://github.com/helius-labs/aeglos, revision
  a4716504d10586d1c87c9a89603bbe5247d5cfd8.
  Copyright (c) 2026 Helius Blockchain Technologies, Inc.
  Available under MIT OR Apache-2.0; these adaptations use Apache-2.0.
  CUDA/PTX primitives are replaced by Rust WASM SIMD operations.
- montgomery, https://github.com/mitschabaude/montgomery, revision
  d03f551105007bd75d0db37865f535812668da2f (the inspected reference). Its delayed-carry arithmetic and
  batch-affine MSM design informed the portable CPU implementation.

